we offer everything

00:23:21.450 --> 00:23:24.080
from roll your own
ffmpeg solutions

00:23:24.080 --> 00:23:27.910
to fully managed backed
solutions with partners.

00:23:27.910 --> 00:23:30.280
And the transcoding
use cases, again,

00:23:30.280 --> 00:23:31.340
is especially compelling.

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:34.190
It runs extremely well
on our per-minute cloud.

00:23:34.190 --> 00:23:36.480
And the massive amount of
storage we have means you

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:38.190
can transcode
everything in parallel

00:23:38.190 --> 00:23:39.920
and be able to
deliver it globally.

00:23:39.920 --> 00:23:40.836
DAVE ELLIOTT: Exactly.

00:23:40.836 --> 00:23:43.490
So these are some good
examples of, once you

00:23:43.490 --> 00:23:47.260
