00:26:20.295 --> 00:26:22.430
With Nearline, we've
reduced the latency down,

00:26:22.430 --> 00:26:23.930
so it's incredibly quick.

00:26:23.930 --> 00:26:26.430
It's under a second for read.

00:26:26.430 --> 00:26:28.940
And we've also removed
